/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 95 0 R
/E (Automated traffic enforcement currently relies on a centralized cloud architecture that is financially and technically inefficient. Traditional traffic cameras are merely dumb sensors that stream massive, continuous 24/7 high-definition video feeds over the internet to a central police control room. This creates three distinct bottlenecks: )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
