141 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (VioLite is an AI-powered traffic enforcement system that processes live video directly at the intersection. A local microcomputer uses computer vision to continuously monitor traffic light phases and track vehicle trajectories in real-time. When a vehicle runs a red light, the system instantly extracts the license plate and sends a lightweight data alert to authorities. Beyond eliminating massive bandwidth costs, this decentralized approach enables instant e-challan generation, and can be easily upgraded via software to catch other infractions like helmetless riding, wrong side driving or triple riding.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
