<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (Zero Video Streaming: Unlike traditional systems that continuously stream heavy, 24/7 video to centralized police servers, VioLite processes everything locally at the edge. It only uses the internet to send a lightweight data packet when a violation actually occurs, cutting municipal bandwidth and cloud computing costs by up to 99%.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
186 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (Context-Aware Tracking: Traditional cameras use static lines or physical road sensors that trigger false challans if a car merely inches forward for an ambulance. VioLite uses predictive AI tracking \(YOLO + DeepSORT\) to analyze the continuous mathematical trajectory of the vehicle, understanding the context of the movement to drastically reduce false positives without destructive road-digging.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
